  "description": "Reusable tenant custom-domain logic for multi-tenant ASP.NET Core SaaS. Real DnsClient.NET verification (CNAME-resolves-to-cluster + TXT ownership-token), a pluggable Kubernetes Ingress provisioner (Traefik addPrefix path-rewrite OR host-routed passthrough, with cert-manager auto-TLS), shared name normalization/validation, a unified status lifecycle, and an opt-in background re-verification poller. The app owns persistence via ICustomDomainStore; the package owns the logic. Provisioner auto-selects Kubernetes vs Noop by service-account-token presence.",
